  "description": "\"I want night classes.\" \n\nWoo Ji-soo becomes a home-visiting tutor to support her family. She takes charge of the children of Won Ju-yul, a director at Dae-ryuk Construction, but there are many problems with conducting the lessons. Students who have no interest in studying at all. And a man more dangerous than the children, Won Ju-yul. With an irresistible amount of money, Ju-yul proposes a 'night class' exclusively for him, after the children's lessons end. \n\nFrom kissing to even more than that.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=853282), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14502142)",
